      "statement": "The generator's own help text warns that MyBatis-Plus annotations are less expressive than Doctrine ORM metadata, so generated SQL is best-effort and must always be manually reviewed for SQL type, nullability, default, comment, indexes, and destructive changes before applying; the script's final output line repeats the review reminder and the migration README says the same.",
