      "statement": "Without --allow-drop, database columns and tables that exist in the database but not in the domain mapping only produce stderr warnings; DROP COLUMN and DROP TABLE statements are generated only when the flag is passed, and flyway_schema_history is always excluded from generated DROP TABLE statements.",
