      "statement": "When the diff produces no statements, bin/make-migration prints 'No changes detected in your mapping information.' and exits 1 without writing a file, unless --allow-empty-diff is passed (writes the file with an explanatory comment) or --empty is used (skips the diff entirely and writes a TODO template, requiring no database connection or pymysql).",
