    {
      "id": "claim_2efe1d72bb204b52bdde20ec3ff564d6",
      "statement": "bin/make-migration migrate and bin/make-migration repair invoke the Flyway Maven plugin (./mvnw -pl ecshopx-bootstrap org.flywaydb:flyway-maven-plugin:<goal>) against the resolved datasource with flyway.locations=filesystem:ecshopx-bootstrap/src/main/resources/db/migration, flyway.baselineOnMigrate=true, flyway.baselineVersion=0, and UTF-8 encoding; neither subcommand accepts a description or extra positional arguments.",
