    {
      "id": "claim_5a9a57da25564fb5ac62077c568bfae6",
      "statement": "@MpTable, @MpId, @MpField, and @MpIndex in ecshopx-common's mybatis/metadata package are meta-annotated with the stock MyBatis-Plus @TableName/@TableId/@TableField and additionally carry Doctrine-ORM-era schema metadata (table comment and indexes; column type, length, precision, scale, nullability, default, comment, uniqueness); MpMetadataAnnotationHandler, registered on MyBatis-Plus' GlobalConfig by MybatisPlusCommonConfig, makes these entities visible to the runtime by synthesizing dynamic Proxy instances of the stock annotations from the @Mp* values.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ecshopx-common/src/main/java/cn/shopex/ecshopx/common/config/MybatisPlusCommonConfig.java#L41-L51",
