      "id": "claim_34b4f8b75e924aefa1b0ce2c7d558ccd",
      "statement": "MigrationSeedRunner, an ApplicationRunner in ecshopx-bootstrap aligned with the legacy PHP EspierBundle\\Listeners\\UpdateMenuListener, seeds the logistics table from classpath:seed/logistics/kuaidi.json only when the table is empty, skipping rows with blank corp_code or corp_name, and catches all exceptions with a WARN log so a logistics seeding failure never blocks startup.",
