    {
      "id": "claim_89b1cad05a9d437b885a42c81eb9dc58",
      "statement": "MigrationSeedRunner.updateSystemMenus() is gated by common.use-system-menu (default true); when enabled it deletes all company_id=0 rows from shop_menu and shop_menu_rel_type and re-imports six menu seed files in a fixed order (platform, it, shop, dealer, merchant, supplier) through ShopMenuUploadService.uploadMenus inside a single programmatic TransactionTemplate transaction — used because the method is self-invoked from run() and proxy-based @Transactional would be bypassed — and any failure propagates and fails startup.",
