    {
      "id": "claim_b50ec10896ae42448613ebf0216b94bb",
      "statement": "The repository ships no application-local.properties — ecshopx-bootstrap/src/main/resources/application-local.properties is listed in .gitignore, making the readme's claim that the project already includes it as a local development sample drift — so bin/make-migration --profile <name> only overlays an application-<name>.properties that the developer creates themselves (both the Bash load_prop helper and the embedded Python loader silently skip a missing overlay file), and profile-based datasource or Flyway overrides require authoring that file first.",
